                Published page: URL and page identity. HTML not supported. Displayed.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="help-hub-edit__field">
              <label for="help-hub-question" class="help-hub-edit__label">Question</label>
              <textarea
                id="help-hub-question"
                class="help-hub-edit__textarea"
                name="question"
                rows={3}>{valueFor("question", "")}</textarea>
